[TITLE]
NUM-02: two streets, one grate inlet each, draining to two different sewer nodes.
Sewer node CN1 also receives 5 cfs of sewer inflow and overflows; all of its
overflow should return to street 1 through inlet S1a, the only inlet draining to it.

